at in Healthy Male Volunteers. <i>Drug metabolism and disposition: the biological fate of chemicals 49(12):1109–1117</i>. DOI:<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1124/dmd.121.000595\">10.1124/dmd.121.000595</a> PUBMED:<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/34625435\">34625435</a></p></li></ol></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Zamek-Gliszczynski_2021: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"),
